<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs $0.50/1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs $0.50/1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>$0.50-1.00 higher. Demand moderate and supply light. Top $56.00</p>
<p>per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    53.50-55.50, few 56.00</p>
<p>US 1-2    210-220 lbs    50.50-53.50</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-230 lbs    52.50-53.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-270 lbs    52.50-53.50</p>
<p>	    270-280 lbs    51.50-52.50</p>
<p>Sows steady. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs    41.00-44.00</p>
<p>	   over 500 lbs    46.00-50.00</p>
</text>
